# Testing

Unit: `*.test.ts` (Node) / `*.test.tsx` (jsdom) beside the file under `src/`; import from `vitest`, no globals. Mock workspace packages that build clients on import (`@repo/auth`, `@repo/storage`). No database. Client Components: `renderWithIntl` from `@/test/render`, query by role.

E2E: `apps/web/e2e/*.spec.ts`, signed out, no `@repo/*` imports. `instant()` from `@next/playwright` for client navigations only.

Test security rules, input parsing and shared contracts — not markup.

**Detail (Read):** [docs/agents/testing.md](docs/agents/testing.md).
